        <title>AT32 USART — 空闲中断接收不定长数据</title>
        <link>https://clingyang.github.io/p/at32-usart-%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B2%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9A%E9%95%BF%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE/</link>
